wgf-autopilot 1
# Asteroids, played through (wgf autopilot; tools/check_games.py runs it headless and in a
# browser): the title; a game -- rocks shot and split for points, then the ship flown
# straight into the field until all three are lost; the game-over screen; and a second
# game started from it. The seed makes the rocks the same every run.
seed 1
at 5 wait asteroids.ready == 1
at 10 expect asteroids.state == 0
at 30 key tap enter
at 31 expect asteroids.state == 1
at 31 expect asteroids.lives == 3
at 40 key down left
at 40 key down space
at 300 expect asteroids.score > 0
at 300 expect ecs.behavior.Rock > 4
at 600 key up space
at 600 key up left
at 600 key down up
at 600 expect asteroids.lives == 3
at 2400 key up up
at 2400 expect asteroids.state == 2
at 2400 expect asteroids.lives == 0
at 2410 key tap enter
at 2412 expect asteroids.state == 1
at 2412 expect asteroids.score == 0
at 2412 expect asteroids.lives == 3
at 2500 end
